<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-10-31T07:11:02.080Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 07:11:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran's IRGC navy says four tankers struck mines and three to four tankers caught fire in the Strait of Hormuz, while Oman rescued 25 people from a burning tanker there. Qatar's negotiators have returned to Tehran for a last-ditch mediation effort and Pakistan's army says it is cautiously optimistic about US-Iran mediation. JD Vance sent a letter to Iran's president urging a restart of peace talks, and the United States cancelled the G20 family photo after European ministers refused to stand with Russia's Lavrov. 123 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/10/31/iran-says-four-tankers-on-fire-after-striking-mines-in-hormuz?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/28/us/politics/vance-peace-talks-letter-iran.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168682&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/liveblog/2026/10/31/iran-war-live-oil-tankers-hit-in-hormuz-trump-says-conflict-will-end-soon?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOOEpYN1k4WGRzNW1fT2pyNHVESDhKWVJlTVNDbTZLVmdhY1lRUDRqT0p2WlpZSmNCUm9McUx2bXROS3E0YVRMbEp4U3V4cDcyNzFEbGZsRVM3a2V5NXRnblpucGtMTFZUMFZsYXZ0M1VxQkR6eTRackRZWmd4VE42RkcyZ043b3hXX0FhazZPdEJjQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxPMzdWakFCLTEzM2pYaGh6ZHpxZE9KMjh2QjkzcE1ieWVwa0dmRFZZWUlOamZJUlpwN0M1ajJuZ3dNRFJ4ZzJwSmFJaGl4cGFWTEZPYmI0UllLZ1lCRzIzWVpNSlhkQnpC